OL,3,GNEWSAObservers to monitor House of Keys
OL,4,Aelection
OL,5,
OL,6,FA team of independent observers will be
OL,7,Farriving on the Isle of Man next week
OL,8,Fto evaluate the fairness, transparency
OL,9,Fand accessibility of the House of Keys
OL,10,Fgeneral election.
OL,12,FOrganised by the Commonwealth
OL,13,FParliamentary Association British
OL,14,FIslands and Mediterranean Region (CPA
OL,15,FBIMR), observers will gather the
OL,16,Fexperiences of those involved in the
OL,17,Fcontest in the run up to the poll on 24
OL,18,FSeptember.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
