OL,3,GNEWSAObservers to monitor House of Keys
OL,4,Aelection
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 10-strong team of observers, who
OL,7,Fwill assess the election against
OL,8,Finternational standards and obligations
OL,9,Falong with Manx laws, will begin
OL,10,Farriving from Tuesday.
OL,12,FIt is the second general election on
OL,13,Fthe island to have been observed by the
OL,14,FCPA BIRM team after a similar mission
OL,15,Fin 2021.
